    "notes": [
      "Goc toa do (0,0,0) dat tai tam mat duoi ban ma chan cot; dinh cot o Z = +3000mm dung yeu cau.",
      "4 bulong neo M24 nam dung toa do (+/-150, +/-150)mm, than bulong an sau xuong Z = -80mm de the hien phan neo trong be tong (nam duoi goc family).",
      "Chieu cao ren/duong kinh ngoai the hien bang khoi tru tron va vat lieu, khong dung ren xoan vi muc tieu tranh over-modeling.",
      "Dinh luc giac dai oc tinh theo R_hex = 20.78mm (SW = 36mm); long den Ø44 day 4mm, dai oc day 20mm, phan tho bulong tren cung 11mm tren dinh dai oc.",
      "Suon tang cuong 10mm dat tai X = +/-50mm, vat cheo tu (Y = +/-145, Z = 170) xuong (Y = +/-200, Z = 50) dung theo mo ta.",
      "Neu can dai oc theo tieu chuan khac (vi du M24 SW36 theo DIN 934) hoac chieu sau neo khac, vui long cho biet de cap nhat tham so."
    ]
